Subject: [PATCH 04/20] lakeside v3.3 load fix B: Array.from instead of
 [...map.values()] (line 18) and [...new Set()] (line 67) - the ES5 build
 emits [].concat(x), so the Set became one element and every load threw
 lakeside-prefab-missing; repo-wide TS AST scan (112 spreads) found no other
 non-array spread; test es5-iterator-spread fails on the old lines

(cherry picked from commit 04da6330489738cadd7bc561110c2155ccb77223)
